qwen3asr adapts the original provider architecture, Whisper preprocessing and
checkpoint mapping to native Go/MLX. The initial qualified execution baseline
promotes original BF16 weights to F32 in memory. It reuses existing Qwen3
transformer primitives; it does not include the provider Python runtime.
