The Qwen3-TTS, Kokoro, Voxtral TTS, and Chatterbox/multilingual-v3/Turbo
implementations in this directory adapt MLX-Audio's model implementations to
Go and Ollama's native MLX operators. Changes include native model import and
asset management, request-local conditioning and sampling, bounded sentence
planning, streaming, cancellation, and lifecycle integration. The original
Python runtime is not included. Family-local license copies are retained in:
