Misaki 0.9.4 English pronunciation dictionaries
https://github.com/hexgrad/misaki
Author: hexgrad (as identified by the source distribution)
Apache License, Version 2.0

Kokoro's English frontend includes the unmodified American/British gold/silver
dictionary JSON payloads from Misaki, compressed with gzip for embedding. The
native Go frontend and its fallback/context rules are adaptations for Ollama;
the dictionaries' source and compressed hashes are retained in
kokoro/english/data/provenance.json. See kokoro/english/data/LICENSE.

