The HiFT lineage is retained alongside the MLX-Audio port attribution. Native
changes include Go data structures, MLX array operations, streaming integration
and explicit final-activation profiles. See chatterbox/HIFT_LICENSE. The
upstream HiFT file also acknowledges HiFi-GAN (jik876/hifi-gan), ParallelWaveGAN
(kan-bayashi/ParallelWaveGAN) and NVIDIA BigVGAN (NVIDIA/BigVGAN).

The build installs this notice as SPEECH_NOTICE and the full applicable license
texts as SPEECH_LICENSE beside the runtime libraries. These cover ported code
and pronunciation dictionaries. Model checkpoints, tokenizers/codecs imported
with a checkpoint, preset voice packs, and reference recordings are separate
user-provided model inputs and are not bundled by this feature.
